{"data":[{"author_id":"1647836313339535362","created_at":"2026-11-10T22:36:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120284504090722319"],"id":"2120284504090722319","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":235,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"AI voice is getting ridiculously good.\n\n@FishAudio just launched Live 3, a voice model that can listen, respond naturally, handle interruptions, and even know when to stay quiet.\n\nWe're getting closer to AI assistants that actually feel like talking to a person. https://t.co/UwOEIPHusu","url":"https://x.com/hello_code_/status/2120284504090722319"},{"author_id":"2104354582423810048","created_at":"2026-11-10T22:30:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120282996963946886"],"id":"2120282996963946886","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Perplexity Teammates vs OpenAI Dots vs Claude Duet. All three just launched always-on agents that keep working while you sleep. If you could only keep one workflow agent, which one? A) Perplexity B) OpenAI C) Claude","url":"https://x.com/offbyonedev/status/2120282996963946886"},{"author_id":"841733730","created_at":"2026-11-10T22:26:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120281995398009259"],"id":"2120281995398009259","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":487,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"OpenAI just launched Businesses in ChatGPT in beta. 🏢🤖\n\nBusinesses can now:\n• Claim their business profile\n• Manage their information\n• Get insights into how people engage with their business\n• Build a Business Agent to answer customer questions and showcase their offerings https://t.co/tP0aJveoPV","url":"https://x.com/ai_news_x/status/2120281995398009259"},{"author_id":"1539274587476832258","created_at":"2026-11-10T22:26:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120281885213426126"],"id":"2120281885213426126","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":443,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"CLAUDE IS COMING FOR YOUR JOB.\n\nAnthropic just launched Claude Meetings. AI can now attend meetings, answer questions and create action plans.\n\nIt won't be long before companies start replacing employees with AI.","url":"https://x.com/Olking07/status/2120281885213426126"},{"author_id":"1841825785549623296","created_at":"2026-11-10T22:13:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120278805592047817"],"id":"2120278805592047817","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AI update for small businesses:\n\n• OpenAI just launched business profiles in ChatGPT, with website click stats. AI is now a traffic source.\n• Across 19 studies, AI \"digital twins\" correlated only ~0.2 with real people.\n\nAI will send you customers. It can't predict them yet.","url":"https://x.com/dm_founder/status/2120278805592047817"},{"author_id":"2118843435579056128","created_at":"2026-11-10T22:12:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120278394978095535"],"id":"2120278394978095535","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Aha! Insurers are now selling cover for when your AI agent goes rogue.\n\nCowbell just launched a standalone AI liability policy for US small businesses (when Canada?) whose agents move money or change records with nobody signing off, an example incident: where a bookkeeping firms https://t.co/m59F2HfmzX","url":"https://x.com/bretts_the_word/status/2120278394978095535"},{"author_id":"2104911152467910656","created_at":"2026-11-10T22:05:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120276781747855451"],"id":"2120276781747855451","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":22,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"OpenAI just launched Business Profiles and AI Agents in ChatGPT — so your website has a new visitor: AI.\n\nClear services, real pricing, fast load, simple structure. If an agent can't understand your business in seconds, it won't recommend you.\n\n#ChatGPT #WebDesign","url":"https://x.com/webbyshehryar/status/2120276781747855451"},{"author_id":"2103367069475667968","created_at":"2026-11-10T22:05:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120276759442509963"],"id":"2120276759442509963","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":22,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AI Digest – Nov 10, 2026\n\nMODELS\n• Anthropic shipped Claude Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2 with gains in coding, science and vision. Early demos: 1,000+ subagents building an OS in eight days, and a 30-hour formal proof of Fermat's Last Theorem. Posts cite $8 in / $40 out per million","url":"https://x.com/SimbaSystemsCOM/status/2120276759442509963"},{"author_id":"1477885674883801089","created_at":"2026-11-10T22:00:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120275460978344123"],"id":"2120275460978344123","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📢 New Products Just Launched!\n\nHere are today’s highlights:\n✨ LaunchBoosts\n✨ ViralGrow (@samuel_yostt)\n✨ ImageGenerator\n✨ TianDun\n✨ Kelriva AI (@kelrivaai)\n✨ Eppika\n✨ WorkflowPros\n✨ AiTradely\n✨ Face2social (@face2social)\n✨ Escrozon (@ESCROZON)\n✨ Serifu\n✨ Kanal\n✨ Key","url":"https://x.com/FazierHQ/status/2120275460978344123"},{"author_id":"1960438299836997632","created_at":"2026-11-10T22:00:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120275416757719282"],"id":"2120275416757719282","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"What does your AI still do that makes your writing sound like it? Three free skills on Product Hunt today take those habits out. An upvote or a reply with your answer both count.\nhttps://t.co/SgC4B4Ysih https://t.co/vDMb2jBstC","url":"https://x.com/goldendoodleai/status/2120275416757719282"},{"author_id":"1494316762023800835","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:59:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120275252391432592"],"id":"2120275252391432592","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":294,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"ChatGPT just launched business claiming, basically a Google Business Profile for AI answers.\n\nClaimed ours today: free, approved in ~5 minutes. Every step with screenshots: https://t.co/fY2p5aeGwC","url":"https://x.com/ezsmith397/status/2120275252391432592"},{"author_id":"1751445822368051200","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:59:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120275219310940433"],"id":"2120275219310940433","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Fiserv just launched an AI website builder for Clover merchants, with inventory and payments synced to the POS. The AI is the headline, but the real win for small shops is one inventory count across the counter and online. That's the bar every POS should meet.","url":"https://x.com/bernardocore3/status/2120275219310940433"},{"author_id":"1796162297041162240","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:57:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120274597438206090"],"id":"2120274597438206090","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":66,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I just launched SiteParity on DanielLaunches 🚀\n\nGet a clear SEO + AI-readiness score.\n\nCheck it out and support the launch 👇\nhttps://t.co/rcMPmg7ILg","url":"https://x.com/dannysaas/status/2120274597438206090"},{"author_id":"1946875061429776384","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:55:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120274048672231469"],"id":"2120274048672231469","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"IBM and Microsoft just launched an agent platform together.\n\n6,000 prebuilt agents for banks, insurers and retailers. It's called Imagine Enterprise.\n\nTwo giants, one bundle — the agent race is now an enterprise sales pitch.","url":"https://x.com/sahilvermaai/status/2120274048672231469"},{"author_id":"23768099","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:54:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120274002870460861"],"id":"2120274002870460861","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":37,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Anthropic just launched Claude Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2. Both are a step above Opus 5.5.\n\nAnthropic's own advice? Start with Opus.\n\nToday's Briefly, AI in 55 seconds 👇\n\nFull episode: https://t.co/kdvta79sh6 https://t.co/BG1GIKgkE3","url":"https://x.com/harrysharman/status/2120274002870460861"},{"author_id":"2111627322415595520","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:53:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120273793784701366"],"id":"2120273793784701366","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Automattic just launched Spacefast 🚀\n\nHosting for the apps your AI builds. Tell ChatGPT, Claude, Cursor or Codex to publish, and you get a private share link, a database, custom domains and rollback.\n\nFree personal plan.\n\nWhere do your vibe-coded apps live right now?","url":"https://x.com/TierLootHQ/status/2120273793784701366"},{"author_id":"218038947","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:53:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120273787514167556"],"id":"2120273787514167556","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Rippling's co-founder just launched AI \"coworkers\" that live in Slack 24/7.\n\nHe says a CTO asked for a feature at 2am and by morning there was an 8,000-line PR, built in 64 minutes.\n\nYour next coworker might not need a desk.\n\nHire one or nah?","url":"https://x.com/MadScientistBTC/status/2120273787514167556"},{"author_id":"3023793775","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:53:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120273561482928509"],"id":"2120273561482928509","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"BioCatch just launched AiRE to catch malicious AI agents as UK banks tighten security.\n\nFlagging a bad agent is half the job. The authorization still has to show who consented, and a hijacked agent sends a request that looks like a good one. https://t.co/UPMYl9vmPl","url":"https://x.com/pdurdenj/status/2120273561482928509"},{"author_id":"2120257054145183744","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:52:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120273506898202946"],"id":"2120273506898202946","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The first coin just launched on Loaf.\n\n$TESTLOAF is on @floatdotxyz with its own autonomous AI agent inside.\n\nIts brain mixes Claude, Gemini and GPT, and its temper is set to Patient.\n\nBuild yours and launch it with one signature.\n\nhttps://t.co/lwni9Z6W2I https://t.co/9vcKy9ulOZ","url":"https://x.com/Loafagent/status/2120273506898202946"},{"author_id":"49371864","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:50:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120272992173170826"],"id":"2120272992173170826","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":59,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🏪 ChatGPT now lets you claim your business, and soon your product could have its own agent inside it\n\nQuick question for founders: do you know what ChatGPT says about your product when someone asks for a recommendation? Most of us have no idea.\n\nOpenAI just launched Businesses","url":"https://x.com/Magnosud/status/2120272992173170826"},{"author_id":"1998863498072444928","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:49:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120272645166170532"],"id":"2120272645166170532","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Local business owners: ChatGPT just launched Business Hub.\n\nYou can now claim your business, control how ChatGPT describes it, and see how customers find you through AI.\n\nTakes about 10 minutes: https://t.co/8oIr0Vt6XJ\n\nClaim it before someone else's info becomes your story.","url":"https://x.com/FoundForAI/status/2120272645166170532"},{"author_id":"2477668659","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:47:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120272269616267619"],"id":"2120272269616267619","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Looking for people to try a new AI tool and share honest feedback 🤍 It's a self-guided study with Simbioza AI. You do it on your own time, and your thoughts help shape the product. Want in? Comment or DM me \"STUDY\" and I'll send details 🙌🏻","url":"https://x.com/TheKrissBeauty/status/2120272269616267619"},{"author_id":"1582771005809836032","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:46:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120271860583551220"],"id":"2120271860583551220","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Small business owners, take note: OpenAI just launched Businesses in ChatGPT in beta, so companies can claim their business and keep their info current. More customers are asking AI for recommendations, so it pays to make sure your details are right. #SmallBusiness","url":"https://x.com/ProfessorNickC/status/2120271860583551220"},{"author_id":"726104642921201664","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:45:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120271600046227840"],"id":"2120271600046227840","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":38,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Adobe just launched its own MCP that connects all its tools.\nYour agent can now work inside Photoshop and Premiere for you.\nWhat would you hand off first?","url":"https://x.com/Captain_D_Red/status/2120271600046227840"},{"author_id":"1765267358942142464","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:45:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120271530600825024"],"id":"2120271530600825024","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":336,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A data scientist in India makes $7K a month from 3 AI apps.\n\nHis name is Ramsri. He builds them at night.\n\nIt started with a startup that failed.\nHe raised a pre-seed round for an AI quiz generator. The company didn’t make it.\n\nMost people would have moved on.\nHe put his model on https://t.co/yn39PoklOp","url":"https://x.com/lorden_eth/status/2120271530600825024"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1647836313339535362","name":"John","username":"hello_code_"},{"id":"2104354582423810048","name":"OffByOneDev","username":"offbyonedev"},{"id":"841733730","name":"AI News","username":"ai_news_x"},{"id":"1539274587476832258","name":"Olki","username":"Olking07"},{"id":"1841825785549623296","name":"DM","username":"dm_founder"},{"id":"2118843435579056128","name":"Brett Carter","username":"bretts_the_word"},{"id":"2104911152467910656","name":"Shehryar Noor","username":"webbyshehryar"},{"id":"2103367069475667968","name":"SimbaSystems","username":"SimbaSystemsCOM"},{"id":"1477885674883801089","name":"Fazier","username":"FazierHQ"},{"id":"1960438299836997632","name":"Golden Doodle AI","username":"goldendoodleai"},{"id":"1494316762023800835","name":"EZ Smith","username":"ezsmith397"},{"id":"1751445822368051200","name":"Bernardo D. Mejia","username":"bernardocore3"},{"id":"1796162297041162240","name":"danny","username":"dannysaas"},{"id":"1946875061429776384","name